If `renderable` is `""` (which is what `Live.get_renderable()` returns if `renderable` is `None`), then `console.render_lines("", options, style=style, pad=False)` will return an empty list of lines.

If `lines` is empty, `shape = Segment.get_shape(lines)` will be `(0, 0)`.
Then `height` will be 0.
`height > options.size.height` will be `0 > some_positive_number`, which is False.
`self._shape` will be `(0, 0)`.

